"""Hand-written knowledge about each control: what it should do and how to check it. gen_controls.py merges this with what it finds in
player.py; anything found there that is not listed here is reported as UNCLASSIFIED.

Rows: (id, area, grammar / label, words, expected result, how to verify, preconditions)
`words` are the keywords of the command grammar the row accounts for (aliases and sub-words included), used to detect drift."""

